<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/nite rates fall to 2.82 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/nite rates fall to 2.82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 2.82 percent on Monday from 3.00 percent on Sunday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded in eight reported transactions worth 12.5 million dinars ($17.6 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
